if(B.d.n(p,"tour")||B.d.n(p,"guide")||B.d.n(p,"how to use")||B.d.n(p,"what can you do")||B.d.n(p,"features")||B.d.n(p,"app"))return A.ir(q,q,!1,"home","Open App Home","**MyIslam** is your comprehensive, all-in-one Islamic spiritual companion!\n\nHere is what you can do right in the app:\n\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcd6 **Holy Quran**: Read the authentic 15-line King Fahd Madani Mushaf with natural RTL page flipping, pinch-to-zoom, and verse recitations.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd4b **Prayer Times & Adhan**: Real-time accurate prayer times, next prayer countdown, and Makkah Adhan audio.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcff **Digital Tasbih**: Animated tactile dhikr bead counter with preset Adhkar and progress loops.\n\u2022 \ud83e\udded **Qiblah Compass**: Instant accurate direction towards the Kaaba.\n\u2022 \ud83e\udd32 **Duas & Hadiths**: Authentic daily supplications and Prophet's sayings.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcb0 **Zakat Calculator**: Calculate your 2.5% wealth purification easily.\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf19 **Fasting Tracker**: Suhoor & Iftar times with fasting intentions.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcfb **Live Quran Radio**: 24/7 recitations from legendary Qaris.\n\nTap any of the quick shortcuts or ask me where you'd like to go!")
if(B.d.n(p,"quran")||B.d.n(p,"mushaf")||B.d.n(p,"surah")||B.d.n(p,"ayah")||B.d.n(p,"page")||B.d.n(p,"yaseen")||B.d.n(p,"mulk")||B.d.n(p,"kahf")||B.d.n(p,"baqarah")||B.d.n(p,"fatiha")){if(B.d.n(p,"mulk"))s="\n\n**Surah Al-Mulk (67)**: The Prophet (\ufdfa) said: *'There is a surah of thirty verses which intercedes for a person until he is forgiven: Tabarak alladhi bi yadihi'l-mulk.'* (Abu Dawood 1400). It is highly recommended to recite every night before sleep!"
else if(B.d.n(p,"kahf"))s="\n\n**Surah Al-Kahf (18)**: Reciting Surah Al-Kahf on Friday illuminates the believer with light from one Friday to the next (Sunan al-Bayhaqi)."
else s=B.d.n(p,"yaseen")?"\n\n**Surah Yaseen (36)**: Known as the heart of the Quran, filled with deep reminders of creation, resurrection, and Allah's mercy.":""
return A.ir("\u0625\u0650\u0646\u064e\u0651 \u0647\u064e\u0670\u0630\u064e\u0627 \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064f\u0631\u0652\u0621\u064e\u0627\u0646\u064e \u064a\u064e\u0647\u0652\u062f\u0650\u064a \u0644\u0650\u0644\u064e\u0651\u062a\u0650\u064a \u0647\u0650\u064a\u064e \u0623\u064e\u0642\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0645\u064f","\u201cIndeed, this Quran guides to that which is most suitable.\u201d (Surah Al-Isra 17:9)",!1,"quran","Open Holy Quran","Our Quran reader gives you the **authentic 15-line Madani Mushaf** published by the King Fahd Complex in Medina with Sheikh Uthman Taha's calligraphy!"+s+"\n\nYou can flip pages by swiping right-to-left, pinch to zoom into the tashkeel, listen to recitation by Sheikh Mishary Alafasy, or switch to the translation mode anytime.")}if(B.d.n(p,"tasbih")||B.d.n(p,"tasbeeh")||B.d.n(p,"dhikr")||B.d.n(p,"subhanallah")||B.d.n(p,"alhamdulillah")||B.d.n(p,"allahu akbar")||B.d.n(p,"istighfar")||B.d.n(p,"bead")||B.d.n(p,"counter"))return A.ir("\u0623\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0627 \u0628\u0650\u0630\u0650\u0643\u0652\u0631\u0650 \u0671\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0650 \u062a\u064e\u0637\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0626\u0650\u0646\u064f\u0651 \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064f\u0644\u064f\u0648\u0628\u064f","\u201cUnquestionably, by the remembrance of Allah hearts are assured.\u201d (Surah Ar-Ra'd 13:28)",!1,"tasbih","Open Digital Tasbih","Remembering Allah (Dhikr) brings deep tranquility to the heart.\n\n**Recommended Daily Dhikr**:\n\u2022 `\u0633\u064f\u0628\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0627\u0646\u064e \u0671\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0650` (SubhanAllah) \u2014 33 times\n\u2022 `\u0671\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0652\u062f\u064f \u0644\u0650\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0650` (Alhamdulillah) \u2014 33 times\n\u2022 `\u0671\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064f \u0623\u064e\u0643\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0631\u064f` (Allahu Akbar) \u2014 34 times\n\u2022 `\u0623\u064e\u0633\u0652\u062a\u064e\u063a\u0652\u0641\u0650\u0631\u064f \u0671\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064e` (Astaghfirullah) \u2014 100 times daily\n\nYou can track all your Adhkar seamlessly using the interactive **Digital Tasbih** in MyIslam with tactile bead animations and milestone celebrations!")
if(B.d.n(p,"prayer")||B.d.n(p,"salah")||B.d.n(p,"salat")||B.d.n(p,"namaz")||B.d.n(p,"adhan")||B.d.n(p,"fajr")||B.d.n(p,"dhuhr")||B.d.n(p,"asr")||B.d.n(p,"maghrib")||B.d.n(p,"isha")||B.d.n(p,"wudu")||B.d.n(p,"tahajjud"))return A.ir("\u0625\u0650\u0646\u064e\u0651 \u0671\u0644\u0635\u064e\u0651\u0644\u064e\u0648\u0670\u0629\u064e \u0643\u064e\u0627\u0646\u064e\u062a\u0652 \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0624\u0652\u0645\u0650\u0646\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e \u0643\u0650\u062a\u064e\u0670\u0628\u064b\u0627 \u0645\u064e\u0651\u0648\u0652\u0642\u064f\u0648\u062a\u064b\u0627","\u201cIndeed, prayer has been decreed upon the believers a decree of specified times.\u201d (Surah An-Nisa 4:103)",!1,"prayer","View Prayer Times","Salah is the second pillar of Islam and the direct spiritual conversation between you and Allah (SWT).\n\n\u2022 **The 5 Daily Prayers**: Fajr (Dawn), Dhuhr (Noon), Asr (Afternoon), Maghrib (Sunset), and Isha (Night).\n\u2022 **Tahajjud**: The night prayer prayed in the last third of the night before Fajr\u2014a time when prayers are directly answered.\n\nCheck today's exact prayer schedule and listen to the Adhan from Makkah in the **Prayer Times** screen!")
if(B.d.n(p,"qiblah")||B.d.n(p,"qibla")||B.d.n(p,"kaaba")||B.d.n(p,"direction")||B.d.n(p,"compass")||B.d.n(p,"makkah"))return A.ir("\u0641\u064e\u0648\u064e\u0644\u0650\u0651 \u0648\u064e\u062c\u0652\u0647\u064e\u0643\u064e \u0634\u064e\u0637\u0652\u0631\u064e \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0633\u0652\u062c\u0650\u062f\u0650 \u0671\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0627\u0645\u0650","\u201cSo turn your face toward al-Masjid al-Haram...\u201d (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:144)",!1,"qiblah","Open Qiblah Compass","The Qiblah is the direction towards the sacred Kaaba at Al-Masjid Al-Haram in Makkah Al-Mukarramah.\n\nTo use the **Qiblah Compass**:\n1. Hold your device flat in the palm of your hand.\n2. Calibrate by gently rotating the device in a figure-8 motion if requested.\n3. Turn your body until the needle aligns directly with the golden Kaaba emblem!")
if(B.d.n(p,"dua")||B.d.n(p,"anxiety")||B.d.n(p,"stress")||B.d.n(p,"sad")||B.d.n(p,"depressed")||B.d.n(p,"protect")||B.d.n(p,"evil eye")||B.d.n(p,"sick")||B.d.n(p,"illness")||B.d.n(p,"forgive")||B.d.n(p,"rizq")||B.d.n(p,"wealth")){if(B.d.n(p,"anxiety")||B.d.n(p,"stress")||B.d.n(p,"sad"))r="\n\n**Dua for Relief from Distress**:\n`\u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064f\u0645\u064e\u0651 \u0625\u0650\u0646\u0650\u0651\u064a \u0623\u064e\u0639\u064f\u0648\u0630\u064f \u0628\u0650\u0643\u064e \u0645\u0650\u0646\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0647\u064e\u0645\u0650\u0651 \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0632\u064e\u0646\u0650\u060c \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u062c\u0652\u0632\u0650 \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0643\u064e\u0633\u064e\u0644\u0650\u060c \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064f\u062e\u0652\u0644\u0650 \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062c\u064f\u0628\u0652\u0646\u0650\u060c \u0648\u064e\u0636\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0639\u0650 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u064e\u0651\u064a\u0652\u0646\u0650 \u0648\u064e\u063a\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0628\u064e\u0629\u0650 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0650\u0651\u062c\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0650`\n*\u201cO Allah, I seek refuge in You from grief and sadness, weakness and laziness, miserliness and cowardice, the burden of debts and being overpowered by men.\u201d* (Sahih al-Bukhari 2893)"
else r=B.d.n(p,"forgive")?"\n\n**Sayyid al-Istighfar (Master of Forgiveness)**:\n`\u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064f\u0645\u064e\u0651 \u0623\u064e\u0646\u0652\u062a\u064e \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0650\u0651\u064a \u0644\u064e\u0627 \u0625\u0650\u0644\u064e\u0647\u064e \u0625\u0650\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0627 \u0623\u064e\u0646\u0652\u062a\u064e\u060c \u062e\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0642\u0652\u062a\u064e\u0646\u0650\u064a \u0648\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0646\u064e\u0627 \u0639\u064e\u0628\u0652\u062f\u064f\u0643\u064e...`\nWhoever recites this with conviction in the evening and dies that night will enter Paradise (Bukhari).":""
return A.ir("\u0648\u064e\u0625\u0650\u0630\u064e\u0627 \u0633\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0643\u064e \u0639\u0650\u0628\u064e\u0627\u062f\u0650\u064a \u0639\u064e\u0646\u0650\u0651\u064a \u0641\u064e\u0625\u0650\u0646\u0650\u0651\u064a \u0642\u064e\u0631\u0650\u064a\u0628\u064c \u06d6 \u0623\u064f\u062c\u0650\u064a\u0628\u064f \u062f\u064e\u0639\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0629\u064e \u0671\u0644\u062f\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0639\u0650 \u0625\u0650\u0630\u064e\u0627 \u062f\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0627\u0646\u0650","\u201cAnd when My servants ask you concerning Me, indeed I am near. I respond to the invocation of the supplicant when he calls upon Me.\u201d (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:186)",!1,"duas","Browse All Duas","Dua is the weapon of the believer and the core of worship! Allah loves when His servants ask Him."+r+"\n\nExplore our categorized library of authentic Duas with Arabic text, transliteration, and English audio in the **Duas section**.")}if(B.d.n(p,"fast")||B.d.n(p,"sawm")||B.d.n(p,"ramadan")||B.d.n(p,"suhoor")||B.d.n(p,"sehri")||B.d.n(p,"iftar"))return A.ir("\u0643\u064f\u062a\u0650\u0628\u064e \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0643\u064f\u0645\u064f \u0671\u0644\u0635\u0650\u0651\u064a\u064e\u0627\u0645\u064f \u0643\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0627 \u0643\u064f\u062a\u0650\u0628\u064e \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0671\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0630\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e \u0645\u0650\u0646 \u0642\u064e\u0628\u0652\u0644\u0650\u0643\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0644\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0643\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u062a\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0651\u0642\u064f\u0648\u0646\u064e","\u201cFasting is prescribed for you as it was prescribed for those before you, that you may attain Taqwa.\u201d (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:183)",!1,"fasting","Open Fasting Tracker","Fasting (Sawm) teaches Taqwa (God-consciousness), self-restraint, and compassion for those in need.\n\n\u2022 **Suhoor**: The pre-dawn meal before Fajr. The Prophet (\ufdfa) said: *'Eat Suhoor, for in Suhoor there is blessing.'* (Bukhari & Muslim).\n\u2022 **Iftar Dua**: `\u0630\u064e\u0647\u064e\u0628\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0638\u064e\u0651\u0645\u064e\u0623\u064f \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0628\u0652\u062a\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0651\u062a\u0650 \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064f\u0631\u064f\u0648\u0642\u064f \u0648\u064e\u062b\u064e\u0628\u064e\u062a\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0623\u064e\u062c\u0652\u0631\u064f \u0625\u0650\u0646\u0652 \u0634\u064e\u0627\u0621\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064f` (*'The thirst is gone, the veins are moistened, and the reward is confirmed, if Allah wills.'*)\n\nCheck live countdowns to Suhoor and Iftar in our **Fasting Tracker**!")
if(B.d.n(p,"zakat")||B.d.n(p,"zakah")||B.d.n(p,"charity")||B.d.n(p,"sadaqah")||B.d.n(p,"nisab"))return A.ir("\u062e\u064f\u0630\u0652 \u0645\u0650\u0646\u0652 \u0623\u064e\u0645\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0670\u0644\u0650\u0647\u0650\u0645\u0652 \u0635\u064e\u062f\u064e\u0642\u064e\u0629\u064b \u062a\u064f\u0637\u064e\u0647\u0650\u0651\u0631\u064f\u0647\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0648\u064e\u062a\u064f\u0632\u064e\u0643\u0650\u0651\u064a\u0647\u0650\u0645 \u0628\u0650\u0647\u064e\u0627","\u201cTake from their wealth a charity by which you purify them and cause them increase...\u201d (Surah At-Tawbah 9:103)",!1,"zakat","Calculate Zakat","Zakat is the third pillar of Islam and purifies your accumulated wealth.\n\n\u2022 **Eligibility (Nisab)**: Wealth held for one full lunar year (Hawl) above the threshold (85 grams of gold or 595 grams of silver).\n\u2022 **Rate**: **2.5%** on net qualifying assets (cash, savings, gold/silver, investment shares, and trade merchandise).\n\nUse our built-in **Zakat Calculator** to instantly calculate your precise due Zakat and donate directly!")
if(B.d.n(p,"radio")||B.d.n(p,"podcast")||B.d.n(p,"listen")||B.d.n(p,"audio")||B.d.n(p,"qari")||B.d.n(p,"reciter"))return A.ir(q,q,!1,"podcasts","Listen to Live Radio","Immerse your home and heart in the beauty of the Quran with **MyIslam Live Radio**!\n\nWe stream 24/7 continuous recitation from world-famous Qaris, including Mishary Rashid Alafasy, Abdul Basit Abdul Samad, Saad Al-Ghamdi, and Abdur-Rahman As-Sudais, with background listening support.")
